# Icirrus City (a town on a marsh, mist on the water and the Dragonspiral Tower over the trees): a slow oboe tune in
# A minor over a soft choir, a harp like drops falling into still water and a deep held bass. At night an ocarina.
# Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U10).
